UID:12303-1777712400-1777726800@orcityfarmersmarket.com
SUMMARY:Oregon City Summer Farmers Market
DESCRIPTION:The Farmers Market Has Moved!\nWe’re now located at Clackamas Community College in Oregon City. Find us in Green Lot #1\, near the corner of S Beavercreek Road and Clairmont Drive. \n Click here to learn more about the new location. \n\n\n\nAbout the Market\nOur year‑round Farmers Market celebrates the best of our region – featuring local growers\, farmers\, ranchers\, bakers\, food producers\, wineries\, distilleries\, cideries\, and artisans \nClick here for our interactive vendor map. \n\n\n\n\nSummer Market Schedule (2026)\nThe Summer Market runs Saturdays\, 9:00am–1:00pm\, from May 2nd through October 31st. We operate outdoors\, rain or shine\, with ample parking and full ADA access. \n\nMarket Programming\nWe’re proud to offer a variety of free\, family‑friendly programs throughout the season: \nPower of Produce (POP) Club\n\n\nA nationally recognized kids’ program offering weekly activities and tokens to purchase fresh produce and veggie plant starts for children ages 5–12. POP empowers kids to make healthy food choices\, learn where their food comes from\, and engage in hands‑on food and garden activities all summer long. Learn more. \nField‑to‑Fork Market Kitchen\nJoin us for cooking samples featuring seasonal produce from our vendors. Learn simple\, budget‑friendly recipes and pick up tips for making the most of your market haul. Learn more. \nLive Music\nEnjoy local musicians every Saturday\, adding a lively soundtrack to your market morning and creating a welcoming community atmosphere. \nOSU Extension Master Gardeners\nVisit the Master Gardener booth for expert advice on plant care\, pest management\, soil health\, and home gardening. They’re here to help you grow with confidence. \n  \nSNAP & Double Up Food Bucks\nWe proudly accept SNAP/EBT\, with up to a $20 Double Up Food Bucks match per market visit—made possible through grant support from Farmers Market Fund. Learn more. \n  \nWeather & Updates\nThe market runs rain or shine\, but may close early or cancel in cases of severe weather. Visit our website for the latest updates\, attending vendors\, and event information. \nWant weekly updates? Subscribe to our mailing list to stay connected with market news\, events\, and vendor highlights.
URL:https://orcityfarmersmarket.com/event/oregon-city-summer-farmers-market-8/2026-05-02/
LOCATION:Oregon City Farmers Market\, Clackamas Community College\, Green Lot #1\, near corner of Beavercreek Road and Clairmont Drive\, Oregon City\, OR\, 97045\, United States
CATEGORIES:Market
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://orcityfarmersmarket.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/04/New-logo.jpg
GEO:45.3328976;-122.5987329
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Oregon City Farmers Market Clackamas Community College Green Lot #1 near corner of Beavercreek Road and Clairmont Drive Oregon City OR 97045 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=Clackamas Community College\, Green Lot #1\, near corner of Beavercreek Road and Clairmont Drive:geo:-122.5987329,45.3328976
END:VEVENT
